        "TileImage": "$($repository 8f6a403f-51da-49ab-939e-34aa98f1d934).Image",
        "Description": "A bomb plot has been discovered apon in Sapienza, Italy. Robert Alves, member of the Amalfi Coast mafia, has called Sal Falcone, private detective to investiagate the life of Jack Please, a waiter at a ice cream shop in town. Robert is planning a terroist attack on the ice cream shop involving C4 and numerous civillians lives lost. Jack Please owes the mafia substantial amounts of money and also, convinentley, to the ICA for a hit dating back to 2018 on his own wife. Kill him, Falcone and Alves.",
